  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting South-South and Triangular Cooperation in SETI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will be a followup to the second UNESCO Engineering Report, Engineering for Sustainable Development: Delivering on the Sustainable Development Goals in the context of accelerating actions to deliver on the Sustainable Development Goals. This activity will focus on S-S, N-S-S cooperation for harnessing engineering innovations especially emerging technologies such as big data and AI for engineering education and capacity-building for the Fourth Industrial Revolution. Capacity building will focus on engineering institution to tackle SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
